TI  - Healing of acute anterior cruciate ligament rupture on MRI and outcomes following non-surgical management with the Cross Bracing Protocol.
AU  - Filbay, Stephanie R
AU  - Dowsett, Matthew
AU  - Chaker Jomaa, Mohammad
AU  - Rooney, Jane
AU  - Sabharwal, Rohan
AU  - Lucas, Phil
AU  - Van Den Heever, Andrew
